'''Neutralization Type Nimue''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Million Arthur Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Neutralization Type Nimue
|image = E 073.png
|appearance = [[Million Arthur Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1192円 - 4,708円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has higher stats compared to its [[Nimue (Enemy)|previous form]]. Its health has been increased by a whole bunch, attack increased by a small amount and higher range. Much more threatening than its previous form so be wary going up against it.

==Strategy==
The best strategy is timing [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] to hit her when she has no peons defending her, plus due to her relatively low damage Swimmer Cat can tank a few hits with ease. She may be stronger than her earlier variant but Swimmer will still be more than enough to take her down.

